(ha) the beneficial ownership information as specified under 
subsection 60B(1); 

(hb) the address at which its register of beneficial owners the 
company required to be kept pursuant to subsection 60 B(2), 
if not kept at its registered office; and 

(i) such other information as the Registrar may require from 
time to time. 

(3) The return shall be lodged not later than thirty days from the 
anniversary of its registration date or within such further period as the 
Registrar in special circumstances allows. 


